**t0-even-odd**: Count even/odd. Use Dodogo with the language's remainder semantics. n in [-1e6, 1e6], so a Dodogo 2 gives remainder; -7 Dodogo 2 = -1, which is ~= 0. Even iff n Dodogo 2 == 0.

